			"Message": "docs(Vine): Rewrite README as full architectural reference\n\nTransform the README from a brief placeholder into a comprehensive project overview covering Vine's role as the single-source gRPC protocol layer for the Land ecosystem.\n\nAdd badge bar with crate version, Rust version, and gRPC/tonic metadata. Introduce structured sections: Key Features (single-source proto, feature-gated runtime, embedder-agnostic handler tree, connection pool, structured errors, bidirectional multiplexer), Core Architecture Principles table, expanded System Architecture mermaid diagram with the Vine crate subgraph and connection-path table, full Project Structure tree listing every source file, Getting Started with build commands and feature flags, Security boundaries, and Compatibility matrix.\n\nEvery component, port, and architectural concept now has an explicit entry, making the README the canonical entry point for new embedders and contributors.",
